cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "OrigamiCP: crease-pattern recovery from images of unfolded sheets"
abstract: >-
  Code, synthetic benchmark generator and capture tooling for recovering an
  origami crease pattern from a single image of the unfolded sheet. Includes the
  fold-condition checks, the physically-based scan renderer, the mask-to-graph
  extractor, and the flip-invariant mountain/valley objective.
type: software
authors:
